9.GR series rebalancing:
    Light GR Lance DPH 100->50, EMP 0->50, DPS/FPS adjusted to 150/120, burst size 4->10, add GR shock effect, an EMP arc chain will occur every 15 hits 
    Heavy GR Lance EMP 0->100, DPS/FPS adjusted to 250/200, burst size 6->15, add GR shock effect
    Storm GR Lance ordnance points 24->21
10.Phantasm, Spectre, Shadow Shadow Long Range Cruise Missiles gained the effect: Cruise Mapping, which increases the maximum speed of friendly ship on the following the missile's path.
    Shadow Long Range Cruise Missile renamed Shadow Twin Cruise Missile, damage 900->1000, range reduced to 4000, refire delay (seconds) 13->10
    Phantasm, Spectre Cruise Missiles seconds / reload 40->30, refire delay (seconds) 3->10
