2.Archon Tuning - Fluxfog removes the impact on flux capacity/flux dissipation. Building in this hullmod will reduce the required peak performance time by half.
3.Archon Tuning - Peakfire building in this hullmod will reduce the required peak performance time by half.
4.Archon Tuning - Crimson Steel building in this hullmod can increase the upper limit of dissipation gain.

